  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Silenced no more</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To highlight and further address the critical issues of SGBV and FGM, and the complexity of communicating and speaking truth to societal power structures steeped in traditions that are at odds with adhering to basic human rights, principles of gender equality and ultimately sustainable development; and 
To create and nurture relations between Kenyan and Danish cultural actors by commissioning and producing a new and contemporary Kenyan/East African play that addresses issues above. Secondly the project also aims to inspire Kenyan cultural practitioners to tackle and take up difficult themes in art and theatre. 

The Embassy of Denmark in Nairobi will closely monitor the implementation of the project and the progress achieved.</narrative>
  </description>
